<title>UK: INSTANT VIEW- Grand Met/Guinness shares up on deal.</title>
<headline>INSTANT VIEW- Grand Met/Guinness shares up on deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Guinness Plc and Grand Metropolitan were indicated sharply higher in pre-market trade on Monday after the surprise announcement of merger plans.</p>
<p>Shares in Guinness climbed 62-1/2p to 579p and Grand Metropolitan gained 63-1/2p to 578-1/2p. Both were indicated over 12 percent higher.</p>
</text>
